==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Snache]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Beastly Nero (Enemy)|Beastly Nero]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

